From e8f1060d617a6b84c4226570863d99bf2250f818 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: FiyeroT <me@fiyero.xyz>
Date: Sat, 26 Sep 2026 20:36:22 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 02/88] utls: firefox -> Firefox 148, safari -> Safari 26.3 (as
 Xray-core)

metacubex/utls Firefox 120 and Safari 16.0 carry no X25519MLKEM768 key share,
so REALITY servers since Xray-core v26.9.8 reject them. Port the specs Xray-core
uses from refraction-networking/utls@aa6edf4, including Firefox's reuse of the
hybrid X25519 key for the classical X25519 share. "random" now picks among
fingerprints that carry X25519MLKEM768 only.
---
 common/tls/reality_client.go |   7 +-
 common/tls/utls_client.go    |  16 +--
 common/tls/utls_spec.go      | 224 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 3 files changed, 238 insertions(+), 9 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 common/tls/utls_spec.go

